      "created_at": "2013-06-08T22:08:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I've exhausted myself searching these forums, BGG, the internet itself, and have been unable to find anything that explains how the Cover keyword, such as on the Cactus or Tumbleweed environment cards. &nbsp;They have hit points, so clearly they are susceptible to damage. &nbsp;But are they things a character has to actually declare they are taking cover behind? &nbsp;What's the deal with COVER?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
