      "created_at": "2013-06-09T01:50:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>A lot of the Time Cataclysm deck's cards take keywords from other decks: \"Cover\" from Silver Gulch, \"Agent\" from the Block, etc. It's a sort of \"when worlds collide\" type environment, so it takes bits and pieces of other Environment decks and includes keywords purely for thematic reasons.</p>",
