      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/vicdigital/{size}/2552_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-06-09T19:08:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks everyone. &nbsp;It was just that the word \"cover\" implies something that protects you, like, from damage. &nbsp; While it's funny, why does a tumbleweed have an HP? &nbsp;Is there any actual situation where that would come into play? &nbsp;Now that I'm writing it, I suppose for attacks that target things with the lowest HP, this would qualify in most cases. &nbsp; &nbsp;Anything else I'm missing?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
