      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Thanks everyone. &nbsp;It was just that the word &quot;cover&quot; implies something that protects you, like, from damage. &nbsp; While it&#39;s funny, why does a tumbleweed have an HP? &nbsp;Is there any actual situation where that would come into play? &nbsp;Now that I&#39;m writing it, I suppose for attacks that target things with the lowest HP, this would qualify in most cases. &nbsp; &nbsp;Anything else I&#39;m missing?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
